            "lines": [
              {
                "en_us": "Movement pathfinding is capped at 64 blocks. ESC hides the interface; right-clicking the terminal or sneaking plus the skill key reopens it.",
                "zh_cn": "移动寻路上限64格。ESC可以隐藏界面，右键终端或潜行+技能键可重新打开。",
                "zh_tw": "移動尋路上限64格。ESC可以隱藏介面，右鍵終端或潛行+技能鍵可重新打開。"
              },
              {
                "en_us": "Error puppets cannot self-detonate with the skill: only 404 can detonate them from the higher dimension terminal, each detonation costing one detonator.",
                "zh_cn": "错误傀儡不能自己按技能自爆：只能由404在高维终端引爆，每次消耗一枚引爆器。",
                "zh_tw": "錯誤傀儡不能自己按技能自爆：只能由404在高維終端引爆，每次消耗一枚引爆器。"
              },
              {
                "en_us": "Shop: free terminal refill, detonator 50, acceleration chip 80 (each chip shortens the assimilation by 5 seconds and is not consumed on failure).",
                "zh_cn": "商店：免费补领终端、引爆器50、加速芯片80（每枚缩短同化5秒，失败不消耗）。",
