    {
      "id": "details",
      "title": {
        "en_us": "Error404",
        "zh_cn": "Error404",
        "zh_tw": "Error404"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "starrailexpress:role_tutorial_room",
          "scale": 1.0,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "starrailexpress:role_player",
          "attachKeyFrame": true,
          "parameters": {
            "pos": [
              3.0,
              1.0,
              3.0
            ],
            "yaw": 180.0,
            "linkId": "error_404_main"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "While on the ground, after aiming at a visible player within 24 blocks for 5 seconds you can assimilate for 15 seconds; moving the crosshair away does not reset the assimilation.",
            "zh_cn": "处于地面状态时，连续瞄准24格内、视线可见的玩家5秒后，可进行15秒同化；移开准星不会重置同化。",
            "zh_tw": "處於地面狀態時，連續瞄準24格內、視線可見的玩家5秒後，可進行15秒同化；移開準星不會重置同化。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            1.8,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 176,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "There are at most 2 error puppets in the \"assimilating\" or \"finished\" state.",
            "zh_cn": "“同化中”与“已完成”的错误傀儡至多存在2个。",
            "zh_tw": "“同化中”與“已完成”的錯誤傀儡至多存在2個。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.08,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 186
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [
            3,
            0,
            3
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "When the assimilation finishes, the original player dies immediately and enters spectator, and an independent error puppet entity spawns in their place.",
            "zh_cn": "同化完成时，原玩家立即死亡并进入旁观，原地生成一个独立的错误傀儡实体。",
            "zh_tw": "同化完成時，原玩家立即死亡並進入旁觀，原地生成一個獨立的錯誤傀儡實體。"
          },
          "point": [
            3.0,
            2.36,
            3.0
          ],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 200
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 190,
          "text": {
            "en_us": "A detonation unfolds a 7x7x7 error space and destroys breakable blocks after 1 second; anyone caught inside is annihilated after staying for 1 second continuously. A 404 inside the higher dimension is immune to this effect.",
            "zh_cn": "引爆会展开7×7×7错误空间，1秒后剥夺可破坏方块；每名笼罩者连续停留1秒后会被湮灭。处于高维中的404免疫此效果。",
            "zh_tw": "引爆會展開7×7×7錯誤空間，1秒後剝奪可破壞方塊；每名籠罩者連續停留1秒後會被湮滅。處於高維中的404免疫此效果。"
          },
